$ unikraft instance template list --help

stdout:
	List instance-templates.

	Usage:
	  unikraft instances template list [<target> ...] [flags]

	Arguments:
	  [<target> ...]
	          Target instance-templates to list.

	Examples:
	  # List instance templates across metros
	  unikraft instance template list

	  # List templates in table format
	  unikraft instance template list -o table

	Fields:
	  metro
	  name
	  uuid
	  tags
	  delete-lock
	  state
	  image
	  runtime, runtime.args, runtime.env
	  resources, resources.memory, resources.vcpus
	  volumes, volumes.*
	  timestamps, timestamps.created
	  scale-to-zero
	  restart, restart.policy
